(2223953, 305996, 28299, '<td valign="top">Great photo; could have also been from "Wicked!" 10</td>', 'Great photo; could have also been from "Wicked!" 10', '2006-03-13 07:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2223961, 305764, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very good saturation and detail.  I like the use of Connex (?) as your works.  I almost did this too, but I was going to do the actual bookcover, with a screaming mouth on the bottom and a photo of a flame on the top.  Of course, nobody would have gotten it who hasn''t seen the book.</td>', 'Very good saturation and detail.  I like the use of Connex (?) as your works.  I almost did this too, but I was going to do the actual bookcover, with a screaming mouth on the bottom and a photo of a flame on the top.  Of course, nobody would have gotten it who hasn''t seen the book.', '2006-03-13 07:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2223967, 305812, 35602, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation of the landscape.  I think it is a little too fluid though.  Maybe a bit more dodge on the foreground, and a sharper focus?</td>', 'Good interpretation of the landscape.  I think it is a little too fluid though.  Maybe a bit more dodge on the foreground, and a sharper focus?', '2006-03-13 07:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2223970, 305246, 35602, '<td valign="top">Don''t know the book, but I do know the author.  I like your background.  It looks very evil.  As a photo, I found it interesting.  It was composed well, and the lighting was really good the way you highlighted the scythe.  8</td>', 'Don''t know the book, but I do know the author.  I like your background.  It looks very evil.  As a photo, I found it interesting.  It was composed well, and the lighting was really good the way you highlighted the scythe.  8', '2006-03-13 07:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2223972, 305506, 53668, '<td valign="top">Hahahahahahah!  Now, what I want to know is how many grapes, ear-buds, and burnt plastic eyeballs did you have to go through to get it right.<br/>I like how each grape has their own expression and character. I like how they all cast their shadows.  Not a clue what the ducks are about (can''t remember the book).<br/>Wish I could vote in this one.  Anything that gives me a genuine bellylaugh gets a 10.</td>', 'Hahahahahahah!  Now, what I want to know is how many grapes, ear-buds, and burnt plastic eyeballs did you have to go through to get it right.I like how each grape has their own expression and character. I like how they all cast their shadows.  Not a clue what the ducks are about (can''t remember the book).Wish I could vote in this one.  Anything that gives me a genuine bellylaugh gets a 10.', '2006-03-13 08:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2223973, 305742, 35602, '<td valign="top">Hard to get these wildlife shots.  Good attempt, but you need to prefocus your spot a bit better.  Maybe even put it on burst mode if you have that on your camera, which would take several consecutive shots together.  Might have gotten a better face of the owl.</td>', 'Hard to get these wildlife shots.  Good attempt, but you need to prefocus your spot a bit better.  Maybe even put it on burst mode if you have that on your camera, which would take several consecutive shots together.  Might have gotten a better face of the owl.', '2006-03-13 08:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2223977, 305926, 35602, '<td valign="top">Well, you seemed to interpret the title well.  Problems included too much grain in the sky.  Need to apply a noise reducer to get rid of that or have a lower iso.  Contrast of water was flat.  A polarizer or neutral density filter would equalize the contrast and add better detail on the water.</td>', 'Well, you seemed to interpret the title well.  Problems included too much grain in the sky.  Need to apply a noise reducer to get rid of that or have a lower iso.  Contrast of water was flat.  A polarizer or neutral density filter would equalize the contrast and add better detail on the water.', '2006-03-13 08:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2223979, 305764, 53668, '<td valign="top">very darn witty!</td>', 'very darn witty!', '2006-03-13 08:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2223980, 305916, 35602, '<td valign="top">Not getting it.  Was that a book or play?  A bit grainy and overprocessed.  You must have had low light and tried to improve exposure after the photo was taken.  Use a tripod and let the camera have a longer exposure and a too dark image won''t be a problem anymore.</td>', 'Not getting it.  Was that a book or play?  A bit grainy and overprocessed.  You must have had low light and tried to improve exposure after the photo was taken.  Use a tripod and let the camera have a longer exposure and a too dark image won''t be a problem anymore.', '2006-03-13 08:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2223983, 305749, 35602, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little dark, though I liked the brighter sky toward the right.  Need more light in the foreground.</td>', 'Maybe a little dark, though I liked the brighter sky toward the right.  Need more light in the foreground.', '2006-03-13 08:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2223984, 304563, 47117, '<td valign="top">This was a favorite quote I used when I was a pageant director!  It was a good one for the girls to ponder on. I am so glad someone used it! Wonderful!!! (10)</td>', 'This was a favorite quote I used when I was a pageant director!  It was a good one for the girls to ponder on. I am so glad someone used it! Wonderful!!! (10)', '2006-03-13 08:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2223987, 305619, 35602, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful interpretaion.  Lighting was really good on this one.  Don''t know the book, but the picture is awesome.  9 because the light on the man was a bit dark, and the left side of the girl.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful interpretaion.  Lighting was really good on this one.  Don''t know the book, but the picture is awesome.  9 because the light on the man was a bit dark, and the left side of the girl.', '2006-03-13 08:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2223989, 305947, 35602, '<td valign="top">Okay, well, thanks for the quote.</td>', 'Okay, well, thanks for the quote.', '2006-03-13 08:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2223991, 305857, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice treatment.  I am certain this was a description from Eliot.  You set a real mood with this one.  Nice placement of the Chrysler building and the Empire State buiilding, and I like the two foreground bridge piecces.  The more I look the better I like the photo.  8</td>', 'Nice treatment.  I am certain this was a description from Eliot.  You set a real mood with this one.  Nice placement of the Chrysler building and the Empire State buiilding, and I like the two foreground bridge piecces.  The more I look the better I like the photo.  8', '2006-03-13 08:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2223995, 305914, 35602, '<td valign="top">What a classic.  Loved that book.  Too bad you couldn''t get the engine moving through a landscape.  Still I give it a 7 because the setting was in need of more thought.</td>', 'What a classic.  Loved that book.  Too bad you couldn''t get the engine moving through a landscape.  Still I give it a 7 because the setting was in need of more thought.', '2006-03-13 08:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2224000, 305419, 35602, '<td valign="top">Not familiar with the book.  As a photo, there was a lot of unbalanced light.  Also it was out of focus.  To remedy the problems, use a tripod if you didn''t, adjust white balance a bit better when you take the shot, and there may be a filter that would have done better at balancing the light, maybe neutral density.</td>', 'Not familiar with the book.  As a photo, there was a lot of unbalanced light.  Also it was out of focus.  To remedy the problems, use a tripod if you didn''t, adjust white balance a bit better when you take the shot, and there may be a filter that would have done better at balancing the light, maybe neutral density.', '2006-03-13 08:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
