(2224299, 305994, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like the posture on the child.  I wonder though what we are missing in the brightness surrounding him.  Nice contrast of light and dark.</td>', 'I like the posture on the child.  I wonder though what we are missing in the brightness surrounding him.  Nice contrast of light and dark.', '2006-03-13 10:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
