(2224309, 305889, 12131, '<td valign="top">Those hands are old enough to have caused some serious trouble.  Makes me wonder who the speaker is...I mean, aside from the obvious choice. Clarity and posture are great here.</td>', 'Those hands are old enough to have caused some serious trouble.  Makes me wonder who the speaker is...I mean, aside from the obvious choice. Clarity and posture are great here.', '2006-03-13 10:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2224313, 305382, 12131, '<td valign="top">Nice imagery.  However I wouldn''t have her look so psychotic.  After all it was a slow process her going crazy and she was a noble woman.  By the way what kind of skull is that? Like the choice for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice imagery.  However I wouldn''t have her look so psychotic.  After all it was a slow process her going crazy and she was a noble woman.  By the way what kind of skull is that? Like the choice for this challenge.', '2006-03-13 10:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2224317, 304412, 12131, '<td valign="top">Funny.  Nice play on words.  And the image isn''t bad either.</td>', 'Funny.  Nice play on words.  And the image isn''t bad either.', '2006-03-13 10:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2224323, 305206, 12131, '<td valign="top">This has a renaissance feel to it.  The color, the effect of the water to make it look painted, the posture of the models--they all make this seem so Michaelangelo-ish.  Though I would have liked to see both their heads above water.</td>', 'This has a renaissance feel to it.  The color, the effect of the water to make it look painted, the posture of the models--they all make this seem so Michaelangelo-ish.  Though I would have liked to see both their heads above water.', '2006-03-13 10:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2224325, 305975, 12131, '<td valign="top">Why is it something so cuddly looking has to be so deadly?  Cute image.  I wonder why the bear looks so forlorn though.</td>', 'Why is it something so cuddly looking has to be so deadly?  Cute image.  I wonder why the bear looks so forlorn though.', '2006-03-13 10:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2224326, 305458, 12131, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice.  Nice job on the colors.</td>', 'Excellent choice.  Nice job on the colors.', '2006-03-13 10:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
