(2225008, 305170, 16912, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this a while now, wondering if the oof foreground adds or detracts from the overall image. I think I''ll side with the photographer and yes, it does help it. I would have cloned out that spot of sensor dust though.<br/> <br/>Simple shot, well lit, composed and nicely fits the title imho.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this a while now, wondering if the oof foreground adds or detracts from the overall image. I think I''ll side with the photographer and yes, it does help it. I would have cloned out that spot of sensor dust though. Simple shot, well lit, composed and nicely fits the title imho.', '2006-03-13 15:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
