(2225035, 304563, 16912, '<td valign="top">Nice clean and crisp shot and the angle shows the body in great detail. I do like the dof behing the butterfly but think the bottom right leaf is a little distracting in full focus.</td>', 'Nice clean and crisp shot and the angle shows the body in great detail. I do like the dof behing the butterfly but think the bottom right leaf is a little distracting in full focus.', '2006-03-13 16:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
