(2232656, 305638, 25355, '<td valign="top">I think the costume doesn''t fit in with Wuthering Heights; it''s more like a medieval dress. (Perhaps Guinevere might have been a better title, from the King Arthur stories.) That''s by the by - there seems to be a bit of blotchiness in the top right corner - cloned out tree or something?</td>', 'I think the costume doesn''t fit in with Wuthering Heights; it''s more like a medieval dress. (Perhaps Guinevere might have been a better title, from the King Arthur stories.) That''s by the by - there seems to be a bit of blotchiness in the top right corner - cloned out tree or something?', '2006-03-16 03:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2232661, 305170, 25355, '<td valign="top">I like the yellow background - I''m not sure about the blurry fron leaf, though. If I had a guess as to whose this is, it may be our musical ursine friend. ;-)</td>', 'I like the yellow background - I''m not sure about the blurry fron leaf, though. If I had a guess as to whose this is, it may be our musical ursine friend. ;-)', '2006-03-16 03:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
