(2236648, 305422, 33400, '<td valign="top">OK, good shot and good idea. But was little red this mature?  I always pictured an innocent little girl off to see Grandma...</td>', 'OK, good shot and good idea. But was little red this mature?  I always pictured an innocent little girl off to see Grandma...', '2006-03-17 19:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
