(2236894, 305997, 33068, '<td valign="top">This shot blew me away when I first saw it. (no pun intended)  You couldn''t of picked a better POV in my opinion.  The dramtic lighting, his expression and the post processing really give it that extra bada bing bada boom.  Well done!</td>', 'This shot blew me away when I first saw it. (no pun intended)  You couldn''t of picked a better POV in my opinion.  The dramtic lighting, his expression and the post processing really give it that extra bada bing bada boom.  Well done!', '2006-03-17 23:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2236906, 305382, 6519, '<td valign="top">Love your idea and set-up, but it lacks some basic post processing. I just tried it with just a simple auto-curves and it made such a big difference !! Good luck, anyway!</td>', 'Love your idea and set-up, but it lacks some basic post processing. I just tried it with just a simple auto-curves and it made such a big difference !! Good luck, anyway!', '2006-03-18 00:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2236909, 305666, 6519, '<td valign="top">Your setup is ever so professional looking, great capture!! The only gripe I have is that the white balance isn''t right - curves would have fixed that.</td>', 'Your setup is ever so professional looking, great capture!! The only gripe I have is that the white balance isn''t right - curves would have fixed that.', '2006-03-18 00:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2236966, 305997, 509, '<td valign="top">I haven''t read the comics, but did see the movie and your photo captures the style of it pretty well.  Some selective coloring might tie in even closer, but its not really necessary.  I like the focus and composition as well.</td>', 'I haven''t read the comics, but did see the movie and your photo captures the style of it pretty well.  Some selective coloring might tie in even closer, but its not really necessary.  I like the focus and composition as well.', '2006-03-18 01:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2236969, 305785, 509, '<td valign="top">I read a few of the books in that series, nice &amp; creative shot.  You''ve captured the scene well.</td>', 'I read a few of the books in that series, nice & creative shot.  You''ve captured the scene well.', '2006-03-18 01:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2236972, 305241, 259, '<td valign="top">great shot.  i really like the simplicity.</td>', 'great shot.  i really like the simplicity.', '2006-03-18 01:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
