(2236977, 304338, 259, '<td valign="top">i really really like this shot.  the curve really makes the shot work.  if it were less centered it would be even better.  still a 10 from me anyway.</td>', 'i really really like this shot.  the curve really makes the shot work.  if it were less centered it would be even better.  still a 10 from me anyway.', '2006-03-18 01:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
