(2237014, 305206, 259, '<td valign="top">my new favorite from this challenge.  still the best after voting.  great point of view, and i really like the dream like quality.  at least for me, this is the kind of stuff i see when i read.  i rarely get literal reproduction of real life.  this is why reading can be so much more intense than movies.</td>', 'my new favorite from this challenge.  still the best after voting.  great point of view, and i really like the dream like quality.  at least for me, this is the kind of stuff i see when i read.  i rarely get literal reproduction of real life.  this is why reading can be so much more intense than movies.', '2006-03-18 01:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237042, 304276, 47402, '<td valign="top">Uhhhhh... it''s a picture of someone else''s picture....</td>', 'Uhhhhh... it''s a picture of someone else''s picture....', '2006-03-18 02:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
