(2237494, 305619, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great poses and use of materials.<br/>His background wing (the one furthest away) catches a bit too much light. But pretty cool photo.</td>', 'Great poses and use of materials.His background wing (the one furthest away) catches a bit too much light. But pretty cool photo.', '2006-03-18 13:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
