(2237651, 305957, 47852, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and peaceful scene.  Love the dark and hazy details in the middle of the shot next to the brighter sky and foreground.  Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful and peaceful scene.  Love the dark and hazy details in the middle of the shot next to the brighter sky and foreground.  Well done!', '2006-03-18 15:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237652, 305506, 47852, '<td valign="top">A laugh out loud kind of entry!  No matter how many times I look at it, I still giggle at it.  The 3rd grape looks a little less angry than the others, he looks more devious.  Anyway.. one of my favorites.  Well done! :)</td>', 'A laugh out loud kind of entry!  No matter how many times I look at it, I still giggle at it.  The 3rd grape looks a little less angry than the others, he looks more devious.  Anyway.. one of my favorites.  Well done! :)', '2006-03-18 15:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237653, 304715, 47852, '<td valign="top">Instantly recognizable, well composed... nice job! :)</td>', 'Instantly recognizable, well composed... nice job! :)', '2006-03-18 15:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237656, 305997, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the angle.. makes a strong composition.  Well done!</td>', 'Love the angle.. makes a strong composition.  Well done!', '2006-03-18 15:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237658, 305422, 47852, '<td valign="top">Isn''t she supposed to be carrying a basket to grandma?  It''s hard to find the right models for these things, but I think this one would have been better with a little girl in costume.  Technically though, it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'Isn''t she supposed to be carrying a basket to grandma?  It''s hard to find the right models for these things, but I think this one would have been better with a little girl in costume.  Technically though, it''s a nice shot.', '2006-03-18 15:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237659, 305684, 47852, '<td valign="top">Adorable moment captured here.  The background seems like it was a bit overprocessed with the unnatural line where the boys face meets the white background, especially right at the ear.</td>', 'Adorable moment captured here.  The background seems like it was a bit overprocessed with the unnatural line where the boys face meets the white background, especially right at the ear.', '2006-03-18 15:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237661, 305279, 47852, '<td valign="top">This is one of those where you look at it.. look some more.. read the title.. and *GROAN*  Cleverly illuminated and very interesting take on the challenge.</td>', 'This is one of those where you look at it.. look some more.. read the title.. and *GROAN*  Cleverly illuminated and very interesting take on the challenge.', '2006-03-18 15:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237664, 305456, 47852, '<td valign="top">Uhm... eww?  Very clever idea for the challenge, wish it was a tad sharper focus (although too sharp would be kind of gross).  Nicely composed too.</td>', 'Uhm... eww?  Very clever idea for the challenge, wish it was a tad sharper focus (although too sharp would be kind of gross).  Nicely composed too.', '2006-03-18 15:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
