(2238061, 305911, 27847, '<td valign="top">Picture Perfect, great capture and really gives justice to the book(s) also.</td>', 'Picture Perfect, great capture and really gives justice to the book(s) also.', '2006-03-18 20:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238077, 305615, 35602, '<td valign="top">Your sky is wonderful.  The background hills are beautiful, and your contrasts are very nice.  The actual grapevines are very hard to make out.  They are really overwhelmed by the stacks holding them.  6</td>', 'Your sky is wonderful.  The background hills are beautiful, and your contrasts are very nice.  The actual grapevines are very hard to make out.  They are really overwhelmed by the stacks holding them.  6', '2006-03-18 20:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238087, 305048, 35602, '<td valign="top">I understand the meaning of the treadmill, but I am not sure if those who haven''t read the book will get the meaning.  As a photo, your treadmill was definitely well lit and contrast is great.  The petals are a nice touch.  6</td>', 'I understand the meaning of the treadmill, but I am not sure if those who haven''t read the book will get the meaning.  As a photo, your treadmill was definitely well lit and contrast is great.  The petals are a nice touch.  6', '2006-03-18 20:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238089, 305666, 35602, '<td valign="top">What a very professional animal portrait.  Very nice job.  8</td>', 'What a very professional animal portrait.  Very nice job.  8', '2006-03-18 20:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238092, 305392, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice angle and placement of horse.  Good face detail.  The brilliant blue sky acts as a wonderful contrast and frame.  8</td>', 'Very nice angle and placement of horse.  Good face detail.  The brilliant blue sky acts as a wonderful contrast and frame.  8', '2006-03-18 21:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238097, 305766, 35602, '<td valign="top">This took a bit of time to set up.  You did a wonderful creation here.  I especially like the touch of the door and sign.  Looks like a magical garden.  8</td>', 'This took a bit of time to set up.  You did a wonderful creation here.  I especially like the touch of the door and sign.  Looks like a magical garden.  8', '2006-03-18 21:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238099, 305026, 30982, '<td valign="top">Somewhat uninspired - just a picture of a book.</td>', 'Somewhat uninspired - just a picture of a book.', '2006-03-18 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238100, 305663, 35602, '<td valign="top">This would be a great entry for hands.  Like the detail and tone of the clear ruler.  Using lower contrast was a good choice.  8</td>', 'This would be a great entry for hands.  Like the detail and tone of the clear ruler.  Using lower contrast was a good choice.  8', '2006-03-18 21:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238101, 305099, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good basic composition but looks a little oversharpened to me.</td>', 'Good basic composition but looks a little oversharpened to me.', '2006-03-18 21:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238102, 304563, 35602, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite poets.  This is a great picture.  I love the detail and clarity of the butterfly.  No pixelization at all and your dof was a wonderful contrast to the sharp leaves.  I am a sucker for butterflies, and this is a really good pic.  10</td>', 'One of my favorite poets.  This is a great picture.  I love the detail and clarity of the butterfly.  No pixelization at all and your dof was a wonderful contrast to the sharp leaves.  I am a sucker for butterflies, and this is a really good pic.  10', '2006-03-18 21:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238103, 305382, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lighting on the skull is good but lighting on Lady Macbeth''s face and hands is flat.</td>', 'Lighting on the skull is good but lighting on Lady Macbeth''s face and hands is flat.', '2006-03-18 21:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238105, 305214, 30982, '<td valign="top">Humorous take on the title.</td>', 'Humorous take on the title.', '2006-03-18 21:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238106, 305495, 35602, '<td valign="top">I think you put too much in the photo.  I would have left out the outer books.  Maybe replaced them with a curtain or draped fabric.</td>', 'I think you put too much in the photo.  I would have left out the outer books.  Maybe replaced them with a curtain or draped fabric.', '2006-03-18 21:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238107, 305860, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ewww!</td>', 'Ewww!', '2006-03-18 21:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238109, 305077, 30982, '<td valign="top">The concept is very good, but the execution is lacking a bit.  The shadow in the right center draws the attention away from Humpty.  But I do like the idea!</td>', 'The concept is very good, but the execution is lacking a bit.  The shadow in the right center draws the attention away from Humpty.  But I do like the idea!', '2006-03-18 21:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238110, 305491, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I''d consider a Barbie book as "literature" but for the younger set, I guess it may well be.  Picture is well composed, a bit bright, but that works.</td>', 'I''m not sure I''d consider a Barbie book as "literature" but for the younger set, I guess it may well be.  Picture is well composed, a bit bright, but that works.', '2006-03-18 21:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238115, 305899, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great potential with this title.  A closer look at the porch/in the door without the white object in the foreground left would have been better.</td>', 'Great potential with this title.  A closer look at the porch/in the door without the white object in the foreground left would have been better.', '2006-03-18 21:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238117, 305279, 30982, '<td valign="top">Clever play on words.</td>', 'Clever play on words.', '2006-03-18 21:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238118, 303995, 30982, '<td valign="top">OK composition, but has a bit of the jaggies.</td>', 'OK composition, but has a bit of the jaggies.', '2006-03-18 21:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238120, 305340, 30982, '<td valign="top">The tree is awesome.  The graves are hard to make out at first.</td>', 'The tree is awesome.  The graves are hard to make out at first.', '2006-03-18 21:20:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2238121, 305506, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gotta love a picture with duckies, flaming cotton swabs, and little eyes on grapes.</td>', 'Gotta love a picture with duckies, flaming cotton swabs, and little eyes on grapes.', '2006-03-18 21:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238128, 305206, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and tone to this. It looks like it could be on the cover of a book. Very artsy.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and tone to this. It looks like it could be on the cover of a book. Very artsy.', '2006-03-18 21:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238129, 305926, 30982, '<td valign="top">The sailboat on the left almost looks like it''s sitting atop the piling.</td>', 'The sailboat on the left almost looks like it''s sitting atop the piling.', '2006-03-18 21:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238132, 305484, 30982, '<td valign="top">Since there''s little color in the foreground, you may want to try this as a blue duotone.</td>', 'Since there''s little color in the foreground, you may want to try this as a blue duotone.', '2006-03-18 21:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238144, 305336, 39287, '<td valign="top">I would of given a higher score except it looks like you moved the camera while snapping... 5</td>', 'I would of given a higher score except it looks like you moved the camera while snapping... 5', '2006-03-18 21:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238184, 304109, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the crinkly look.  The lighting on the child''s fingers is nice.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the crinkly look.  The lighting on the child''s fingers is nice.', '2006-03-18 22:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238187, 306008, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, focus and lighting.  Might have been nicer with a bit more natural background.</td>', 'Good DOF, focus and lighting.  Might have been nicer with a bit more natural background.', '2006-03-18 22:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238189, 305815, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''d almost like to see a live person in this shot as well.</td>', 'I''d almost like to see a live person in this shot as well.', '2006-03-18 22:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238190, 304906, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good lines and perspective.</td>', 'Very good lines and perspective.', '2006-03-18 22:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238191, 305150, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this.', '2006-03-18 22:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238192, 304276, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s a good picture of a book, particularly given the perspective of the pages.</td>', 'It''s a good picture of a book, particularly given the perspective of the pages.', '2006-03-18 22:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238194, 304918, 30982, '<td valign="top">Given the limited color here, it may work better in black and white.  You chose an excellent book.</td>', 'Given the limited color here, it may work better in black and white.  You chose an excellent book.', '2006-03-18 22:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238240, 305817, 24846, '<td valign="top">What a great job lining your nest...A regal composition with such great detail helped defined by your dof. Good luck -8-</td>', 'What a great job lining your nest...A regal composition with such great detail helped defined by your dof. Good luck -8-', '2006-03-18 22:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238253, 304338, 24846, '<td valign="top">Weight or lightness? You masterfully captured both here. A watercolor type cast accented by the erotic shape of the aquarium. Maybe something that was painted by "Sabina" to torment "Tomas". -8-</td>', 'Weight or lightness? You masterfully captured both here. A watercolor type cast accented by the erotic shape of the aquarium. Maybe something that was painted by "Sabina" to torment "Tomas". -8-', '2006-03-18 22:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238254, 305781, 24846, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image without a ripple. Good luck -8-</td>', 'A beautiful image without a ripple. Good luck -8-', '2006-03-18 22:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238258, 305048, 24846, '<td valign="top">So sad without Algernon. Lovely image, good luck.</td>', 'So sad without Algernon. Lovely image, good luck.', '2006-03-18 22:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2238268, 305493, 24846, '<td valign="top">I really like this, and it would have been just as appealing without the rabbit. Great color, highlights and composition. The door blends so well. Good luck.</td>', 'I really like this, and it would have been just as appealing without the rabbit. Great color, highlights and composition. The door blends so well. Good luck.', '2006-03-18 22:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
