(2239683, 305418, 42005, '<td valign="top">This is just as I would hope to think was in the author''s mind.....9</td>', 'This is just as I would hope to think was in the author''s mind.....9', '2006-03-19 18:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239685, 305889, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like how the grip on that stone is so tight it looks quite believable that it is about to be thrown.</td>', 'I like how the grip on that stone is so tight it looks quite believable that it is about to be thrown.', '2006-03-19 18:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239745, 305717, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the colors, but there appears to be some strange artifacts throughout the image, particularly on the boy''s face.  I see that the image is about 150 kb, so I''m not sure what the cause for this would be.</td>', 'I like the subject and the colors, but there appears to be some strange artifacts throughout the image, particularly on the boy''s face.  I see that the image is about 150 kb, so I''m not sure what the cause for this would be.', '2006-03-19 19:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239748, 305089, 509, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  I like that the tonality of the water closely matches that of the sky, creating a uniform background.  The exposure and composition are very good as well.</td>', 'Great picture.  I like that the tonality of the water closely matches that of the sky, creating a uniform background.  The exposure and composition are very good as well.', '2006-03-19 19:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239794, 305383, 35602, '<td valign="top">Liked the concept, but your light balance is problematic.  The dark areas are really dark and the highlights are really blown out.  Perhaps a bit more work on correcting exposures in post processing, such as more dodging and burning.  From the camera, a polarizer or neutral density filter definitely would have helped to correct the balance of light.</td>', 'Liked the concept, but your light balance is problematic.  The dark areas are really dark and the highlights are really blown out.  Perhaps a bit more work on correcting exposures in post processing, such as more dodging and burning.  From the camera, a polarizer or neutral density filter definitely would have helped to correct the balance of light.', '2006-03-19 19:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239797, 304045, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really clear and precise.  Loved the tones on this one, and the eyes came out really nice.  10</td>', 'Really clear and precise.  Loved the tones on this one, and the eyes came out really nice.  10', '2006-03-19 19:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239804, 305895, 35602, '<td valign="top">Love the expression on this one.  A bit more light on the right might have put this one over the top.  One way to add a little more light without flash is to use a reflecting board or mirror where the shadow is darkest.  The light on the left would have probably reflected just enough from the right to put that part of the face in better light.  I use foamcore board as my reflector boards.  Available even at places like CVS Pharmacy.  8</td>', 'Love the expression on this one.  A bit more light on the right might have put this one over the top.  One way to add a little more light without flash is to use a reflecting board or mirror where the shadow is darkest.  The light on the left would have probably reflected just enough from the right to put that part of the face in better light.  I use foamcore board as my reflector boards.  Available even at places like CVS Pharmacy.  8', '2006-03-19 19:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239805, 305241, 35602, '<td valign="top">Needs to be closer and more focused.</td>', 'Needs to be closer and more focused.', '2006-03-19 19:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239808, 305165, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really like the dark edges on this one.  Don''t know the book or the author but the picture makes me want to check it out to see what the book is about.  9</td>', 'Really like the dark edges on this one.  Don''t know the book or the author but the picture makes me want to check it out to see what the book is about.  9', '2006-03-19 19:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239813, 305860, 35602, '<td valign="top">Love the green.  Very smooth image.</td>', 'Love the green.  Very smooth image.', '2006-03-19 19:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239823, 305099, 35602, '<td valign="top">I think that the image is way too dark.  The foreground makes the image look a bit messy.  The sky is wonderful, though, and if the dark area is water I think too much detail is lost.  Your title is well placed, though.</td>', 'I think that the image is way too dark.  The foreground makes the image look a bit messy.  The sky is wonderful, though, and if the dark area is water I think too much detail is lost.  Your title is well placed, though.', '2006-03-19 19:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239837, 305899, 35602, '<td valign="top">They actually wrote a book about that?  Well, I like the idea of trying to depict it, but there are a few issues with this photo.  The house in the background is very distracting.  Use a more shallow dof.  The wires in the foreground could have been darkened to black in post processing where there is white so they wouldn''t have shown as much.  I did not care for the trees in the foreground or the telephone pole.  Event he generator or something to the left is very distracting.  To get a better image, you might have tried to get closer.  Think too many distracting elements were placed in the photo.</td>', 'They actually wrote a book about that?  Well, I like the idea of trying to depict it, but there are a few issues with this photo.  The house in the background is very distracting.  Use a more shallow dof.  The wires in the foreground could have been darkened to black in post processing where there is white so they wouldn''t have shown as much.  I did not care for the trees in the foreground or the telephone pole.  Event he generator or something to the left is very distracting.  To get a better image, you might have tried to get closer.  Think too many distracting elements were placed in the photo.', '2006-03-19 19:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239853, 305916, 35804, '<td valign="top">I just really like this...the color, the grain, the light...the "feel" of it...the setting makes me curious...so nice.</td>', 'I just really like this...the color, the grain, the light...the "feel" of it...the setting makes me curious...so nice.', '2006-03-19 19:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239869, 305418, 45596, '<td valign="top">Way, way, cool.  In your details, please state what you did to the photo to make it look this way.</td>', 'Way, way, cool.  In your details, please state what you did to the photo to make it look this way.', '2006-03-19 20:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239870, 305346, 45596, '<td valign="top">Interesting.</td>', 'Interesting.', '2006-03-19 20:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239943, 304596, 42005, '<td valign="top">The shadows of the clouds is eery......the photo is delightful on all levels. Thank you for sharing.</td>', 'The shadows of the clouds is eery......the photo is delightful on all levels. Thank you for sharing.', '2006-03-19 21:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239945, 306007, 42005, '<td valign="top">Magnificent action....title.....clarity, energy.  What more can I say?</td>', 'Magnificent action....title.....clarity, energy.  What more can I say?', '2006-03-19 21:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2239949, 305813, 42005, '<td valign="top">Very good shot albeit somewhat troubling on a level I have yet to identify. The light on the hair is quite powerful and the focus is top notch.  Beautiful child.  Perhaps there is more vulnerability here than<br/>peace...not sure why.  I like it though.</td>', 'Very good shot albeit somewhat troubling on a level I have yet to identify. The light on the hair is quite powerful and the focus is top notch.  Beautiful child.  Perhaps there is more vulnerability here thanpeace...not sure why.  I like it though.', '2006-03-19 21:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
