(2239954, 305302, 42005, '<td valign="top">Clever.  The chicken soup sort of glares at me and I now must go to my cupboard to see if Cambell;s uses more than one color of blue for their swish.</td>', 'Clever.  The chicken soup sort of glares at me and I now must go to my cupboard to see if Cambell;s uses more than one color of blue for their swish.', '2006-03-19 21:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
