(2242444, 305048, 34041, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 10 on this - it''s great, both technically and for the story. I''m sure a lot of people haven''t read the book, so they didn''t get how perfect this image was to the story.  Great job, and way under-rated.  It''s in my favorites.<br/></td>', 'I gave you a 10 on this - it''s great, both technically and for the story. I''m sure a lot of people haven''t read the book, so they didn''t get how perfect this image was to the story.  Great job, and way under-rated.  It''s in my favorites.', '2006-03-20 18:06:54.000000', NULL, 0),
