(2242571, 305997, 36988, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for the very much appreciated comments. Means alot to me... :)</td>', 'Thank you everyone for the very much appreciated comments. Means alot to me... :)', '2006-03-20 19:08:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2242584, 305302, 42005, '<td valign="top">I do not think you should take the voting as any interpretation against your climbing out on a climb. It is a most interesting take on the title and if executed a tad differently, certainly would have<br/>scored higher.  The competition was TOUGH here and your scores reflect some very nice feelings<br/>on behalf of the voters.  You over-reached the bell curve...mmore sexes and sevens than fours and threes.  For this you should be patting yourself on the back. DO NOT step away from your humor.<br/>Keep trying square pegs in round holes. You will come up with something great.  I think did well.</td>', 'I do not think you should take the voting as any interpretation against your climbing out on a climb. It is a most interesting take on the title and if executed a tad differently, certainly would havescored higher.  The competition was TOUGH here and your scores reflect some very nice feelingson behalf of the voters.  You over-reached the bell curve...mmore sexes and sevens than fours and threes.  For this you should be patting yourself on the back. DO NOT step away from your humor.Keep trying square pegs in round holes. You will come up with something great.  I think did well.', '2006-03-20 19:15:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2242586, 305992, 26936, '<td valign="top">Magnifique!  We ended up w/3'' of snow in the yard....</td>', 'Magnifique!  We ended up w/3'' of snow in the yard....', '2006-03-20 19:17:31.000000', NULL, 0),
