(2260360, 305615, 14476, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>Delightful image that pleased many of our voters in this Challenge.  I suspect you used a polarizer to obtain those deep blues and dark reds.  All though there is some vignetting in the sky it is not particularly out of character within the image.<br/> <br/>And yes, when I voted on this image during the Challenge, I too noticed the lack of Grapes, or even vines.  However, because of the strength of the photograph i also voted it fairly high.  I think you made the best of what you had and came up with a pretty good Challenge entry.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club  Delightful image that pleased many of our voters in this Challenge.  I suspect you used a polarizer to obtain those deep blues and dark reds.  All though there is some vignetting in the sky it is not particularly out of character within the image. And yes, when I voted on this image during the Challenge, I too noticed the lack of Grapes, or even vines.  However, because of the strength of the photograph i also voted it fairly high.  I think you made the best of what you had and came up with a pretty good Challenge entry. Keep up the good work.', '2006-03-26 17:03:01.000000', NULL, 0),
