(2277264, 305817, 24454, '<td valign="top">Jacque, this is AMAZING!!!!   I am totally bewildered why it only scored 5.1!!!  You can see every single little feather, and they are razor sharp!   I love the clean colors.  The expression on his face.   I think the voters <i>reeeeeeallly</i> missed it on this one!!  The only thing I can see that could even possibly be seen as taking a hit is just a tiny tiny bit of highlights on his chest and top of his head that maybe could have been been fixed by creating a layer mask and upping the levels to darken those areas, and then erasing out the rest of it to let the background show thru.   Other than that, I think there''s no way this isn''t scoring in the mid 6''s!   I think you take great pictures!!!!!</td>', 'Jacque, this is AMAZING!!!!   I am totally bewildered why it only scored 5.1!!!  You can see every single little feather, and they are razor sharp!   I love the clean colors.  The expression on his face.   I think the voters reeeeeeallly missed it on this one!!  The only thing I can see that could even possibly be seen as taking a hit is just a tiny tiny bit of highlights on his chest and top of his head that maybe could have been been fixed by creating a layer mask and upping the levels to darken those areas, and then erasing out the rest of it to let the background show thru.   Other than that, I think there''s no way this isn''t scoring in the mid 6''s!   I think you take great pictures!!!!!', '2006-03-31 21:03:34.000000', NULL, 0),
